{"ID":"20240519104437-c84v6hk","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240519104437-c84v6hk","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240519104437-c84v6hk\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240519104437-6rx0wv3\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240519104437-6rx0wv3\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240519104437-6rx0wv3\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"砒霜","type":"doc","updated":"20240902135042"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240718165445-9qt47co","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240718165445-9qt47co","updated":"20240718165445"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"砒霜"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/砒霜-20240718165445-elan0uj.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240730104509-5a2cgj4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240730104509-5a2cgj4","updated":"20240730104607"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"注：据说鹤顶红就是砒霜，因为古代提炼工艺有限，所以古代的提炼出来的砒霜呈红，才有鹤顶红一名；"}]},{"ID":"20240718165449-rsrn5if","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240718165449-rsrn5if","updated":"20240730104508"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"二"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"注：为砒石经升华而成的三氧化二砷精制品。"}]},{"ID":"20240718171239-lve96cp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240718171239-lve96cp","updated":"20240718171250"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"《本草纲目·石三·砒石》中记载：“砒石，生者名砒黄，鍊者名砒霜。砒，性猛如貔，故名。惟出信州  ，故人呼为信石；而又隐信字为人言。”天然的砒石，也叫砒黄，经练制后叫砒霜。因产地在信州，所以叫信石，信字拆开，隐讳一点的说法称为人言。"}]},{"ID":"20240718171322-jidx0rs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240718171322-jidx0rs","updated":"20240718171330"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"《本草蒙筌》中记录了砒霜的炼制方法：“信石近铜山处俱有，信州井者独佳，块大色黄，明澈不杂。此生砒者，谓之砒黄。置火上以器覆之，令砒烟上着凝结，累累垂下。如乳尖长，才名砒霜，入药方妙。”取大块黄色清澈的砒石，打碎放在容器中加热，蒸发后会在容器顶部冷凝出象石钟乳一样的结晶体，收集后捻碎即成砒霜，可以作为药来使用了。"}]},{"ID":"20240718171331-g470nyr","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240718171331-g470nyr"}},{"ID":"20240902135035-qf3k3m1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135035-qf3k3m1","updated":"20240902135042"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中草药：砒霜"}]},{"ID":"20240902135035-ah69a1y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135035-ah69a1y","updated":"20240902135101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"砒霜《*辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240902135035-tikl3n5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135035-tikl3n5","updated":"20240902135101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【出处】《日华子本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240902135035-9058cvz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135035-9058cvz","updated":"20240902135101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】PīShuānɡ"}]},{"ID":"20240902135035-s3j420f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135035-s3j420f","updated":"20240902135101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】为砒石经升华而得的精制品，参见\"砒石\"条。"}]},{"ID":"20240902135035-joifryx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135035-joifryx","updated":"20240902135101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【制法】《本草衍义》:\"将生砒就置火上，以器覆之，令砒烟上飞，着覆器，遂凝结，累然下垂如乳尖，长者为胜，平短者次之。大块者已是下等，片如细屑者极下也，入药当用如乳尖长者。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902135035-3pau02u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135035-3pau02u","updated":"20240902135101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】为白色粉末，无臭，无味，能溶于水、乙醇、酸类及碱类。加热则升散而发蒜臭。"}]},{"ID":"20240902135035-0k0a57f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135035-0k0a57f","updated":"20240902135101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【药理作用】参见\"砒石\"条。"}]},{"ID":"20240902135035-s93absy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135035-s93absy","updated":"20240902135101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】"}]},{"ID":"20240902135035-zd9atho","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135035-zd9atho","updated":"20240902135101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"辛酸，热，有毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240902135035-kuqobah","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135035-kuqobah","updated":"20240902135101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《开宝本草》:\"味苦酸，有毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902135035-4c0ipds","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135035-4c0ipds","updated":"20240902135101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《玉楸药解》:\"辛，热，大毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902135035-5icc8rv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135035-5icc8rv","updated":"20240902135101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】《玉楸药解》:\"入脾、肺、肝经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902135035-vay9ikc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135035-vay9ikc","updated":"20240902135101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】"}]},{"ID":"20240902135035-l0j2sc9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135035-l0j2sc9","updated":"20240902135101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"劫痰截疟，杀虫，蚀恶肉。治寒痰哮喘，疟疾，休息痢，梅毒，痔疮，瘰疬，走马牙疳，癣疮，溃疡腐肉不脱。"}]},{"ID":"20240902135035-ettwjxx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135035-ettwjxx","updated":"20240902135101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《日华子本草》:\"治妇人血气冲心痛，落胎。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902135035-lomnhch","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135035-lomnhch","updated":"20240902135101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《开宝本草》:\"主诸疟，风痰在胸膈，可作吐药。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902135035-zzupfgl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135035-zzupfgl","updated":"20240902135101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《本草蒙筌》:\"截疟除吼，膈上风痰可吐；溃坚磨积，腹内宿食能消。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902135035-kos5ugq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135035-kos5ugq","updated":"20240902135101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《医学入门》:\"主恶疮瘰疬，腐肉，和诸药敷之，自然蚀落。又治蛇尿着人手足，肿痛肉烂，指节脱落。为末，以胶清调涂。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902135035-u75qjbk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135035-u75qjbk","updated":"20240902135101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤《纲目》:\"蚀痈疽败肉，枯痔，杀虫。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902135035-9vzea5l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135035-9vzea5l","updated":"20240902135101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥《玉楸药解》:\"治寒痰冷癖，久疟积痢，疗痔漏瘰疬，心疼呴喘，蚀痈疽腐肉，平走马牙疳。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902135035-vujtn35","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135035-vujtn35","updated":"20240902135101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】内服:入丸、散，1～5毫。外用:研末撒或调敷，或入膏药中贴之。"}]},{"ID":"20240902135035-5ltemd0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135035-5ltemd0","updated":"20240902135101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【注意】"}]},{"ID":"20240902135035-3b3hsrt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135035-3b3hsrt","updated":"20240902135101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本品毒性比砒石更剧，内服极宜谨慎。体虚及孕妇忌服。"}]},{"ID":"20240902135035-wet14i4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135035-wet14i4","updated":"20240902135101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《品汇精要》:\"畏绿豆、冷水、醋。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902135035-744cpf3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135035-744cpf3","updated":"20240902135101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草蒙筌》:\"畏羊血。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902135035-rje7tv9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135035-rje7tv9","updated":"20240902135101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《医学折衷》:\"大伤胸气，脾胃虚者，切宜戒之。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902135035-9svxs54","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135035-9svxs54","updated":"20240902135101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【附方】"}]},{"ID":"20240902135035-u20ingb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135035-u20ingb","updated":"20240902135101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①治哮嗽:砒霜、面、海螵蛸各一钱。为末，水调作饼子，慢火炙黄，再研令细。每服一字，用井花水作一呷，服良久，吐出为度。小儿减半。忌食热物。（《赤水玄珠》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902135035-qhxx88s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135035-qhxx88s","updated":"20240902135101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治久恶疮:砒霜一分（细研），附子一分（末），苦参一分（末），硫黄一分（细研），蜡一分。用麻油二两煎，油热下蜡，次下药末，和令匀成膏。每用，先以蒴藋、柳枝煎汤洗疮，拭干，日二涂之。（《圣惠方》砒霜膏）"}]},{"ID":"20240902135035-qlysiwb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135035-qlysiwb","updated":"20240902135101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治癣不问干湿，积年不差:砒霜一分，硫黄三分，密陀僧三分，腻粉二分。上药细研为末。癣干即以生油调涂，若癣湿，即用药末掺之。（《圣惠方》砒霜散）"}]},{"ID":"20240902135035-na8cue9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135035-na8cue9","updated":"20240902135101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【各家论述】"}]},{"ID":"20240902135035-u4l8411","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135035-u4l8411","updated":"20240902135101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本草衍义》:\"砒霜，疟家或用，才过剂，则吐泻兼作，须浓研绿豆汁，仍兼冷水饮。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902135035-sd0f7sa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135035-sd0f7sa","updated":"20240902135101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《医学折衷》:\"疟丹多用砒霜大毒之药，《本草》谓主诸疟风痰在胸膈，可作吐药，盖以其性之至燥，大能燥痰也。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902135035-p1eadpq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135035-p1eadpq","updated":"20240902135101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《本草经巯》:\"砒霜，禀火之毒气，复经煅炼，《开宝本草》虽云味苦酸，而其气则大热，性有大毒也。酸苦涌泄，故能吐诸疟风痰在胸膈间。太热大毒之物，故不可久服，能伤人也。\"\"砒黄既已有毒，见火则毒愈甚，而世人多用砒霜以治疟，不知《内经》云夏伤于暑，秋必痎疟，法当清暑，益气，健脾，是为正治，岂宜用此大热大毒之药。如果元气壮实，有痰者服之，必大吐，虽暂获安，而所损真气实多矣。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902135035-9w1wusc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135035-9w1wusc","updated":"20240902135101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《本经逢原》:\"砒霜疟家常用，入口吐利兼作，吐后大渴，则与绿豆汤饮之。砒性大毒，误食必死。然狂痴之病，又所必需，胜金丹用之无不应者。枯痔散与白矾同用，七日痔枯自落，取热毒之性以枯歹肉也。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902135035-zkt30fc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135035-zkt30fc","updated":"20240902135101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【临床应用】治疗哮喘：用砒霜1铰，淡豆豉1两，加工制成紫金丹1000粒，每晚临睡前服1～6粒。开始先用1～2粒，如无明显反应，再逐渐增至足量。治疗11例，除1例合并有肺门淋巴结核效果不满意外，其余均能基本控制症状。通常服药1天后见效，3天后症状基本控制。少数服药后有轻度头痛头晕，颜面浮肿，可在服药后3～5天内自行消失。部分病例出现食欲减退、转氨酶增高，经使用酵母片、维生素及中药大枣、茵陈汤后均恢复正常；但有的又出现脑絮++，似说明本品对肝脏有一定损害。有人认为，砒对支气管哮喘有特殊疗效。对寒哮最为适宜；但亦有人指出:砒剂对热带嗜酸性白细胞增多性哮喘固有疗效，但对支气管哮喘症则无效。因此，砒剂治疗究适用于那一类型的哮喘，尚待进一步探索。"}]},{"ID":"20240902135035-srjbmr3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135035-srjbmr3","updated":"20240902135101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《*辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240902135035-ezd90xg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135035-ezd90xg","updated":"20240902135101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"砒霜《中华本草》《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240902135035-go8ia5x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135035-go8ia5x","updated":"20240902135101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【出处】"}]},{"ID":"20240902135035-uz7qchd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135035-uz7qchd","updated":"20240902135101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出自《日华子本草》。"}]},{"ID":"20240902135035-bxl3jdn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135035-bxl3jdn","updated":"20240902135101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.《本草图经》：砒霜，旧不着所出郡县，今近铜山处亦有之，惟信州者佳。其块有甚大者，色如鹅子黄，明澈不杂。此类本处自是难得之物，每一两大块，真者人竞珍之，市之不啻金价。古服食方亦或用之，必得此类，乃可入药。其市肆所蓄，片如细屑，亦夹土石，入药服之，为害不浅。误中，解之用冷水研绿豆浆饮之。"}]},{"ID":"20240902135035-1t8ngxu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135035-1t8ngxu","updated":"20240902135101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《本草别说》：信州玉山有砒井。生不夹石者，色赤，甚如雄黄，近火即杀人，《"}]},{"ID":"20240902135035-euagpmb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135035-euagpmb","updated":"20240902135101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】PīShuānɡ"}]},{"ID":"20240902135035-yax5xvs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135035-yax5xvs","updated":"20240902135101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【英文名】Arsenic"}]},{"ID":"20240902135035-oj98z7w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135035-oj98z7w","updated":"20240902135101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】白砒"}]},{"ID":"20240902135035-bcmhjs5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135035-bcmhjs5","updated":"20240902135101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】"}]},{"ID":"20240902135035-hh98tzn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135035-hh98tzn","updated":"20240902135101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药材基源：为砒石经升华而得的精制品。"}]},{"ID":"20240902135035-ltdgpz9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135035-ltdgpz9","updated":"20240902135101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：Arsenolite;Arsenopyrite;Realgar;Orpiment"}]},{"ID":"20240902135035-2wzgiyd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135035-2wzgiyd","updated":"20240902135101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】"}]},{"ID":"20240902135035-4waykj9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135035-4waykj9","updated":"20240902135101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.晶形为八面体，偶尔也有菱形十二面体。歪晶为粒状、板柱状；微晶呈星状、毛发状；集合体呈钟乳状、皮壳状和土状。无色至灰白色，多数带灰蓝、黄或红色色调。条痕白色或带有黄色。有玻璃至金刚样光泽，无晶面可见时则为油脂、丝绢样光泽。解理多组完全，交呈棱角。极脆。硬度为1.5。相对密度为3.7-3.9。能缓慢溶解于水。有剧毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240902135035-0q34jqw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135035-0q34jqw","updated":"20240902135101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.毒砂晶体结构属单斜或三斜晶系。晶形多呈柱状，有时为短柱、板柱、双锥状或致密粒块、致密块状等集合体。新鲜面呈锡白色至钢灰色。条痕黑色。金属光泽，不透明，晶体解理中等或不完全，块状集合体见不到解理，断口不平坦。硬度5.5-6。相对密度5.9-6.3。性脆，致密块体用铁锤猛击时有火星，可发出蒜臭气。"}]},{"ID":"20240902135035-xon58ux","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135035-xon58ux","updated":"20240902135101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.雄黄晶体结构属单斜晶系。晶体细小，呈柱状、短柱状或针状，但较少见。通常多呈粒状，致密块状，有时呈土状、粉末状、皮壳状集合体。橘红色，表面或有暗黑及灰色的锖色。条痕浅橘红色。晶体呈金刚光泽，断口树脂光泽。硬度1.5-2，相对密度3.56，阳光久照会发生破坏而转变为淡橘红色粉末。锤击之有刺鼻蒜臭。"}]},{"ID":"20240902135035-t68j8mw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135035-t68j8mw","updated":"20240902135101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.雌黄单斜晶系。晶体常呈柱状，往往带有弯曲的晶面，集合体则呈杆状、块状、鸡冠状。柠檬黄色，有时微带浅褐色。条痕与矿物本色相同，惟色彩更为鲜明。光泽视方向不同而变化，由金刚光泽至脂肪光泽，新鲜断面呈强烈的珍珠光泽。半透明。解理完全。硬度1.5-2。比重3.4-3.5。具柔性，薄片能弯曲，但无弹性。"}]},{"ID":"20240902135035-2g8u9cm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135035-2g8u9cm","updated":"20240902135101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】"}]},{"ID":"20240902135035-3b1ow7n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135035-3b1ow7n","updated":"20240902135101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生态环境：1.毒砂在地表易风化成臭葱石等土状风化物，表面为褐黄、黄白、灰白、绿、红褐、黄褐、黑褐等色，被膜覆盖处，光泽暗淡，硬度低于小刀甚至低于指甲。呵气于臭葱石等土状风化物上，可闻到带砷的臭味。火烧之有升华物，伴发蒜臭气并熔成磁性小球。"}]},{"ID":"20240902135035-6qqr3ft","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135035-6qqr3ft","updated":"20240902135101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.雄黄主要为低温热液、火山热液矿床中的典型矿物，与雌黄紧密共生。还见于温泉沉积和硫质喷气孔的沉积物里。偶尔发现于煤层和褐铁矿层中，为有机质分解所产生的硫化氢与含砷溶液作用的产物。"}]},{"ID":"20240902135035-8z2t9sg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135035-8z2t9sg","updated":"20240902135101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.雌黄产于低温热液矿床中，温泉及火山附近也有存在，形成条件完全与雄黄相似，并且与雄黄辉锦矿等密切共生。"}]},{"ID":"20240902135035-q16m9mf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135035-q16m9mf","updated":"20240902135101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：1.砷华主产于江西、湖南、广东、贵州等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240902135035-dxmj95r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135035-dxmj95r","updated":"20240902135101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.毒砂产出于硫化物矿脉中，或粒状分散于矿脉及围蚀变带中，此时多与白色绢云母、铜黄色“金星状”黄铁矿共存。除古产地陕西、湖北、河南、四川、甘肃、辽宁、山西等地仍有产出外，山东、江西、广东、广西、湖南、吉林、青海、西藏、内蒙古、新疆等地亦有产出。"}]},{"ID":"20240902135035-7uv7pj5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135035-7uv7pj5","updated":"20240902135101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.雄黄主产于甘肃、湖北、湖南、四川、贵州、云南等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240902135035-g8zzgq6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135035-g8zzgq6","updated":"20240902135101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.雌黄主产于甘肃、湖北、湖南、四川、贵州、云南等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240902135035-v1nyrbw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135035-v1nyrbw","updated":"20240902135101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】性状鉴别本品为块片或粉末状。白色，体重，无臭，无味，极毒，不可口尝。"}]},{"ID":"20240902135035-8wmfvxj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135035-8wmfvxj","updated":"20240902135101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【化学成份】主要是三氧化二砷(As2O3)。"}]},{"ID":"20240902135035-p3ym5ov","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135035-p3ym5ov","updated":"20240902135101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【药理作用】三氧化二砷具有砷剂的基本药理和毒理。砷有原浆毒作用，且能麻痹毛细血管，抑制含疏基酶的活性，并使肝脏脂变、肝小叶中心坏死，心、肝、肾、肠充血，上皮细胞坏死，毛细血管扩张。枯痔散中含有白砒，如给兔耳每日涂敷，可致干性坏死，以至脱落；实验表明，不含三氧化二砷的制品则无此作用。枯痔散中含砷量为8-16%左右，易自粘膜面吸收，应用不当，可致急性砷中毒。作为杀灭虫害的农药，误服中毒者亦有报道。"}]},{"ID":"20240902135035-b1yuf8p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135035-b1yuf8p","updated":"20240902135101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【鉴别】(1)取本品少量，置闭口管中加热，生成白色升华物。（检查砷盐）(2)取本品少量，置木炭火烧之，发生白色气体，并有蒜臭气，于木炭上显一层白色被膜。（检查砷盐）(3)取本品少量，加水煮沸，使溶解，溶液呈弱酸性，通硫化氢则生成黄色沉淀。（检查砷盐）(4)差热分析曲线吸热335℃（小），825℃（微）；放热740℃（小），230℃开始到740℃前，失重—属砷华。"}]},{"ID":"20240902135035-q6ktyvp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135035-q6ktyvp","updated":"20240902135101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【炮制】《本草衍义》：将生砒就置火上，以器覆之，令砒烟上飞，着覆器，遂凝结，累然下垂如乳尖，长者为胜，平短者次之。大块者已是下等，片如细屑者极下也，入药当用如乳尖长者。"}]},{"ID":"20240902135035-elwlhl8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135035-elwlhl8","updated":"20240902135101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】辛；酸；热；有毒"}]},{"ID":"20240902135035-nolze1p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135035-nolze1p","updated":"20240902135101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】脾；肺；胃；大肠经"}]},{"ID":"20240902135035-6p7ipku","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135035-6p7ipku","updated":"20240902135101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】劫痰；蚀疮去腐；截疟；蚀腐；杀虫。主寒痰哮喘；疟疾；休息痢；痔疮；瘰疬；走马牙疳；癣疮；痈疽恶疮"}]},{"ID":"20240902135035-lnse2pi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135035-lnse2pi","updated":"20240902135101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】内服：入丸、散，1-5毫。外用：研末撒或调敷，或入膏药中贴之。"}]},{"ID":"20240902135035-1sascti","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135035-1sascti","updated":"20240902135101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【注意】"}]},{"ID":"20240902135035-6zdjp2y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135035-6zdjp2y","updated":"20240902135101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本品毒性比砒石更剧，内服极宜谨慎。体虚及孕妇忌服。"}]},{"ID":"20240902135035-86v1a6u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135035-86v1a6u","updated":"20240902135101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.《品汇精要》：畏绿豆、冷水、醋。"}]},{"ID":"20240902135035-zitz2qm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135035-zitz2qm","updated":"20240902135101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《本草蒙筌》：畏羊血。"}]},{"ID":"20240902135035-iidzw3c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135035-iidzw3c","updated":"20240902135101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《医学折衷》：大伤胸气，脾胃虚者，切宜戒之。"}]},{"ID":"20240902135035-we934lz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135035-we934lz","updated":"20240902135101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【各家论述】"}]},{"ID":"20240902135035-icot9vb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135035-icot9vb","updated":"20240902135101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.《本草衍义》：砒霜，疟家或用，才过剂，则吐泻兼作，须浓研绿豆汁，仍兼冷水饮。"}]},{"ID":"20240902135035-9rp9lib","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135035-9rp9lib","updated":"20240902135101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《医学折衷》：疟丹多用砒霜大毒之药，《本草》谓主诸疟风痰在胸膈，可作吐药，盖以其性之至燥，大能燥痰也。"}]},{"ID":"20240902135035-ohyxjno","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135035-ohyxjno","updated":"20240902135101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《本草经疏》：砒霜，禀火之毒气、复经煅炼，《开宝本草》虽云味苦酸，而其气则大热，性有大毒也。酸苦涌泄，故能吐诸疟风痰在胸膈间。大热大毒之物，故不可久服，能伤人也。砒黄既已有毒，见火则毒愈甚，而世人多用砒霜以治疟，不知《内经》云夏伤于暑，秋必疡疟，法当清暑，益气，健脾，是为正治，岂宜用此大热大毒之药。如果元气壮实，有痰者服之，必大吐，虽暂获安，而所损真气实多矣。"}]},{"ID":"20240902135035-rjvuw96","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135035-rjvuw96","updated":"20240902135101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.《本经逢原》：砒霜疟家常用，入口吐利兼作，吐后大渴，则与绿豆汤饮之。砒性大毒，误食必死。然狂痴之病，又所必需，胜金丹用之无不应者。枯痔散与白矾同用，七日痔枯白落，取热毒之性以枯歹肉也。"}]},{"ID":"20240902135035-9gf5tx3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135035-9gf5tx3","updated":"20240902135101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.《日华子本草》：治妇人血气冲心痛，落胎。"}]},{"ID":"20240902135035-p9sssje","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135035-p9sssje","updated":"20240902135101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6.《开宝本草》：主诸疟，风痰在胸膈，可作吐药。"}]},{"ID":"20240902135035-wo9ghc3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135035-wo9ghc3","updated":"20240902135101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7.《本草蒙筌》：截疟除吼，膈上风痰可吐；溃坚磨积，腹内宿食能消。"}]},{"ID":"20240902135035-353op90","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135035-353op90","updated":"20240902135101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8.《医学入门》：主恶疮瘰疬，腐肉，和诸药敷之，自然蚀落。又治蛇尿着人手足，肿痛肉烂，指节脱落。为末，以胶清调涂。"}]},{"ID":"20240902135035-ljalh7e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135035-ljalh7e","updated":"20240902135101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9.《纲目》：蚀痈疽败肉，枯痔，杀虫。"}]},{"ID":"20240902135035-idtpuvt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135035-idtpuvt","updated":"20240902135101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"10.《玉揪药解》：治寒痰冷癖，久疟积痢，疗痔漏瘰疬，心疼齁喘，蚀痈疽腐肉，平走马牙疳。"}]},{"ID":"20240902135035-ej69gfg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135035-ej69gfg","updated":"20240902135101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《中华本草》《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240902135036-p8cc9tb","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240902135036-p8cc9tb","updated":"20240902135101"}},{"ID":"20240902135037-olj623s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902135037-olj623s","updated":"20240902135101"}}]}